<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  ABYSS_SHEET_DONOR_PORT_1. The ysvaltha: one of the Abyss's black, many-eyed kin, a made killer. Owned port of the
  Alpha Animals dusk prowler (sarg.alphaanimals AA_DuskProwler, 1.6/Defs/ThingDefs_Races/Races_DuskProwler.xml);
  name and description are the owner's sheet ruling 2026-10-05. Free RM_ tier, ONE HOME: the Abyss. Stats, tools,
  race fields and pawnkind numbers are the donor's own, EXCEPT these donor-only references:
    - body AA_FourEyedQuadruped -> vanilla QuadrupedAnimalWithPawsAndTail
    - the donor's "ninetails" flurry (Stab 3 / cooldown 0.2 on the donor-only AA_Tail part group) is DROPPED:
      no vanilla body carries a tail attack group. Its barbed-tail / shoulder-blade attack is OWED (needs our own
      BodyDef or part group; not built here), so for now it fights with claws, bite and head only.
    - leatherDef Leather_Night -> Leather_Wolf (PROVISIONAL substitute)
    - the VEF stat extension dropped.
  ART: abyss_ysvaltha_v3 (east/south/north, finished in the artpipe), installed 2026-10-06 via the art ledger at the texPath below.
-->
<Defs>

  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>RM_Ysvaltha</defName>
    <label>ysvaltha</label>
    <description>Something bred for killing rather than born to it: a long, low, sinuous body in near-black hide, a whip of a tail fringed with crimson barbs, and a narrow, needle-pointed head set with four glowing yellow eyes. Along its shoulders it carries curved, crimson-edged blades folded back like swept wings; they fling it forward faster than the eye can follow and open as it strikes. The dark masters who made it are long gone; their hounds were hunted almost to nothing, and few who see one see it twice.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MoveSpeed>6.00</MoveSpeed>
      <ComfyTemperatureMin>-30</ComfyTemperatureMin>
      <ComfyTemperatureMax>30</ComfyTemperatureMax>
      <MarketValue>750</MarketValue>
      <ArmorRating_Blunt>0.1</ArmorRating_Blunt>
      <ArmorRating_Sharp>0.1</ArmorRating_Sharp>
      <FilthRate>2</FilthRate>
      <Wildness>0.75</Wildness>
    </statBases>
    <tools>
